      "description": "Watch FC Sion vs Ajax Amsterdam highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 20, 2026. FC Sion and Ajax faced off in a highly anticipated UEFA Conference League clash on August 20, 2026, delivering a spectacle filled with tactical shifts and individual brilliance. The atmosphere at the stadium was electric as both sides looked to establish dominance in this European encounter. Sion Take the Initiative The match began with significant physical intensity, reflected early on when Baltazar received a yellow card. FC Sion capitalized on their home advantage in the 34th minute. Ali Kabacalman provided a pinpoint assist for Franck Surdez , who finished clinically to put the hosts ahead. Ajax struggled to find their rhythm in the opening period, with Youri Regeer picking up a booking as the Swiss side held their narrow lead into the break. The Amsterdam Fightback The second half saw Ajax emerge with renewed purpose after introducing Jorthy Mokio for Regeer . Their persistence paid off in the 53rd minute when Julian Brandt found the back of the net to level the score. The momentum shifted completely, and by the hour mark, the visitors had turned the game around. Anton Gaaei turned provider for Marcos Leonardo , who calmly finished to give Ajax their first lead of the night. Late Drama and Decisive Blows The contest took another dramatic turn in the 71st minute when Ilyas Chouaref converted a penalty for FC Sion to make it 2-2. However, Ajax responded with ruthless efficiency. Substitute Tolu Arokodare made an immediate impact, scoring in the 74th minute to restore the lead. Arokodare then turned creator in the 87th minute, setting up Davy Klaassen for a clinical finish that sealed a 4-2 victory. Despite late yellow cards for Gaaei and Owen Wijndal , Ajax successfully navigated a chaotic finale to claim the points."
